<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers on a live basis were not well tested, compared with Wednesday, USDA said. Steers - Select and Choice 2-3 1100 lbs few 69.00.</p>
<p>Carcass Basis Steers not well tested. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1175-1275 lbs 111.00-112.00. Reported sales for Wed -  700  Week to Date - 5,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
